          "title": "Old-Script Idioms",
          "items": [
            "`[ \"x$x\" = \"xy\" ]` predates reliable quoting",
            "`[ \"$x\" = \"-n\" ]` misparses in ancient shells",
            "Portable AND: `[ a ] && [ b ]`",
            "`-a` / `-o` are deprecated and ambiguous"
